4. DigitalOcean Kubernetes

This surprises many people.

Kubernetes itself is free to manage on DigitalOcean—you pay for the worker nodes and any attached resources. Basic worker nodes start at $12/month per node.

For production, I would start with:

2 Basic Nodes

2 vCPU

4GB RAM

≈ $24/month total

That provides redundancy compared with a single node.

