My recommendation

For an MVP, I would budget around $120–$150/month even though the expected infrastructure cost is closer to $106/month. That extra buffer covers things like bandwidth overages, backups, additional storage, container registry usage, or temporary increases in compute during testing.

Once QGuard Helix starts generating recurring revenue, you can scale Kubernetes nodes, Redis, storage, and monitoring independently without needing to redesign the architecture. That makes this a solid foundation that balances cost with room to grow. 🚀